sequenceDiagram
    participant API as FastAPI\nPOST /api/v1/assessments
    participant ORCH as AssessmentOrchestrator
    participant ING as IngestionAgent
    participant SEC as SecEdgarClient
    participant GIBS as NasaGibsImageryProvider
    participant VIS as VisionAgent
    participant SCORE as IntelligenceScoringAgent
    participant REPORT as ReportAgent
    participant NIM as NvidiaNimClient
    participant WATCH as WatchlistAgent
    participant DB as Repository / SQLite

    API->>ORCH: run(company)
    activate ORCH
    ORCH->>ING: run(company)
    activate ING
    ING->>SEC: fetch_financial_signals(ticker)
    SEC-->>ING: {revenue, rd, capex}\neach AVAILABLE or INSUFFICIENT_DATA
    ING->>GIBS: fetch_change_pair(lat, lon)
    GIBS-->>ING: current/prior tiles\neach AVAILABLE or INSUFFICIENT_DATA
    ING-->>ORCH: financial_signals, tiles, data_sources
    deactivate ING
    Note over ORCH: agent_trace["ingestion_agent"] recorded\n(status, duration, summary -- never fabricated)

    ORCH->>VIS: run(current_tile, prior_tile)
    activate VIS
    VIS-->>ORCH: VisionFindings\n(construction/vegetation signals)
    deactivate VIS
    Note over ORCH: agent_trace["vision_agent"] recorded

    ORCH->>SCORE: run(financial_signals, vision_findings, data_sources)
    activate SCORE
    Note over SCORE: data-sufficiency gate:\nexclude untrusted/None signals,\nrenormalize, or return INSUFFICIENT_DATA
    SCORE-->>ORCH: MomentumAssessmentResult
    deactivate SCORE
    Note over ORCH: agent_trace["intelligence_scoring_agent"] recorded

    ORCH->>REPORT: run(company, momentum_result, vision_findings)
    activate REPORT
    REPORT->>NIM: generate_intelligence_briefing(...)\n(or offline_briefing when no live-data/API key)
    NIM-->>REPORT: narrative text
    REPORT-->>ORCH: NarrativeReport
    deactivate REPORT
    Note over ORCH: grounding critic checks every numeric\nclaim against structured evidence;\nungrounded text is replaced with the\ndeterministic template, never published
    Note over ORCH: agent_trace["report_agent"] recorded

    ORCH->>WATCH: run(company_name, momentum_level, momentum_score)
    activate WATCH
    WATCH-->>ORCH: WatchlistDecision\n(NONE tier + not-flagged when INSUFFICIENT_DATA)
    deactivate WATCH
    Note over ORCH: agent_trace["watchlist_agent"] recorded

    ORCH->>DB: persist AssessmentRecord\n(+ data_sources, evidence, data_quality)
    ORCH-->>API: AssessmentResult
    deactivate ORCH
